{"In `BlockedEmail.should_block?`, doing a read-modify-write and `save` on every check causes potential race conditions and overhead - consider using `update_columns`/`increment_counter` and skipping validations": 0.6686556935310364, "Use the array change key `rejectedEmails.[]` instead of `@each` for a string array dependency - `@each` won't reliably track changes for primitive strings, only for observing properties on objects": 0.7580035328865051, "The lookup `BlockedEmail.where(email: email).first` can be simplified to `find_by(email: email)` since only the first record is ever used": 0.02545483037829399, "In `CreateAccountController`, `rejectedEmails` can grow indefinitely and `pushObject` may add duplicates - should switch to `addObject` and clear the array when the modal is closed or signup succeeds": 0.37953153252601624}